  action,floor1-atrium-greeter-employee2
@this
  +lookAtEachOther(Ada, AtriumGreeterEmployee)
  +setConversation(Ada)
  +:question(Ada)
  Ada: "So <color=LIGHTRED>Carl-Arnold</> is actually the reason why I am here."
  Ada: "He invited me here to talk to me.  He told me he is on the second floor.  Can you direct me up there?"
  +:teardrop(AtriumGreeterEmployee)
  AtriumGreeterEmployee: "<cascade-letters>Um..."
  AtriumGreeterEmployee: "You can find a map of the facility by the elevators."
  AtriumGreeterEmployee: "That will be particularly helpful if you are lost."
  Ada: "I am not lost. <scale=0.75> I <scale=0.5>just <scale=0.25>asked..."
  AtriumGreeterEmployee: "Look, every other person walking in those doors claims to be a friend of <color=LIGHTRED>Carl-Arnold</>."
  AtriumGreeterEmployee: "Please just go to the front desk and don't cause me any trouble."
  +:flat(Ada)
  Ada: "Whatever.  Nevermind.  I can probably find the second floor on my own."
  +endConversation()
@floor1-atrium-greeter-employee2
  +lookAtEachOther(Ada, AtriumGreeterEmployee)
  +setConversation(Ada)
  AtriumGreeterEmployee: "On behalf of the arcade staff, we hope you have a wonderful time!"
  +endConversation()
@floor1-atrium-greeter-employee-step
  +setConversation(Ada)
  +stopAi(AtriumGreeterEmployee)
  +walkToOffset(AtriumGreeterEmployee, 0, 12)
  +:ld(AtriumGreeterEmployee, leftdown)
  +:ld(Ada, rightup)
  AtriumGreeterEmployee: "Hello there!"
  +panCameraToFitCharacters(500, false, Ada, AtriumGreeterEmployee)
  AtriumGreeterEmployee: "<cascade>Welcome to the <color=LIGHTBLUE>Regem Ludos Arcade</>!"
  +setConversationSpeaker(none)
  +walkToMarker(AtriumGreeterEmployee, MarkerGreeterC, 0, 0, true)
  +walkToMarker(Ada, MarkerFloor1AtriumGreeterEmployeeWalk)
  +walkPartyToFormation()
  +lookAtEachOther(Ada, AtriumGreeterEmployee)
  +panCameraToFitCharacters(500, false, Ada, AtriumGreeterEmployee)
  AtriumGreeterEmployee: "Oh! <delay=200 cascade>You're from that prep high school school <color=LIGHTPURPLE>Erran Valley<cascade> right?"
  +lookAtEachOther(Ada, AtriumGreeterEmployee)
  Ada: "Yes, I am.  Is it obvious?"
  +:happy(AtriumGreeterEmployee)
  AtriumGreeterEmployee: "Oh yeah. I can recognize you lot from a mile away. Something about you kids from that school is just... exciting."
  AtriumGreeterEmployee: "I just have this feeling that something crazy is bound to happen with one of you around."
  +:lightbulb(AtriumGreeterEmployee)
  AtriumGreeterEmployee: "The current first place on the leaderboard is actually someone from <color=LIGHTPURPLE>Erran Valley</>."
  +:ld(AtriumGreeterEmployee, up)
  AtriumGreeterEmployee: "We track the current leader up there!"
  +none()
  +panCameraRelativeToPlayer(55, -155)
  Ada: "You cannot be serious... You have a picture of <italic>him</> here?"
  AtriumGreeterEmployee: "Yeah it's pretty crazy.  <color=LIGHTRED>Carl-Arnold</> has been at the top of the leaderboard for a <italic>long</> time."
  +none()
  +panCameraBackToPlayer()
  +:ld(AtriumGreeterEmployee, leftdown)
  Conscience: "So... it kinda seems like he wants to show off to you, doesn't it."
