  +setConversationSpeaker(none)
  +waitMS(1000)
  Ada: "<scale=1.25 cascade-letters=250>So.<delay=200 cascade> I am simply thinking out <cascade-letters=100>loud..."
  Ada: "How about we find a way to sneak up to the second floor and not deal with any of this <color=LIGHTBLUE>Battle</> nonsense?"
  +setConversationSpeaker(none)
  +waitMS(500)
  +setFacing('Conscience', 'right')
  +waitMS(50)
  +setFacing('Conscience', 'up')
  +waitMS(250)
  +callScript('utils-character-jump', 'Conscience')
  +:exclaim(Conscience)
  Conscience: "<cascade=100>No, no, no!"
  Conscience: "We are <shake>DEFINITELY</> going in there.  I want to see it!"
  Ada: "I did not come here to defeat <color=LIGHTRED scale=1.25>MONSTERS</>.<delay=500 cascade=33> I just want to find <color=LIGHTRED>Carl-Arnold</> and then get out with as little problems as possible."
  Conscience: "C'mon, it totally sounds fun!"
  +setConversationSpeaker(none)
  +waitMS(1000)
  +:sad(Conscience)
  Conscience: "<scale=2 cascade-letters=75>Please!!</> You NEVER let me have any fun!"
  +setConversationSpeaker(none)
  +waitMS(1000)
  Ada: "I don't think it's a good idea."
  +:sad(Conscience)
  +waitMS(500)
  +:bored(Ada)
